        "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCLAMER</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER: CURRENTLY REDOING THE VISUALS AND MAIN GAME MODE ALONGSIDE MULTIPLAYER. WHEN THOSE ARE DONE THE OTHER STUFF WILL START BEING REDONE AS WELL BUT WILL NOT BE APART OF THE GAME UNTIL FUTURE UPDATES. SO WISH LIST IT IF YOU ARE WAITING FOR THAT.</h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER: CURRENTLY REDOING THE VISUALS AND MAIN GAME MODE ALONGSIDE MULTIPLAYER. WHEN THOSE ARE DONE THE OTHER STUFF WILL START BEING REDONE AS WELL BUT WILL NOT BE APART OF THE GAME UNTIL FUTURE UPDATES. SO WISH LIST IT IF YOU ARE WAITING FOR THAT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far can you run before the ground disappears beneath you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Square Run: Endless Run is a fast-paced arcade platformer where platforms vanish behind you as you race to survive. Collect coins, push your limits, and beat your personal best — one run at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your challenge:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy</strong> — find your footing and learn the flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal</strong> — the pressure builds fast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard</strong> — only the quickest survive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend your coins in the shop to go further:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your base speed and jump height</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow the disappearing platforms with a special coin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the Second Wind — a one-time lifeline that pulls you back from the edge when you fall</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More ways to play:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race to the Finish</strong> — a set course unlocked after upgrading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer</strong> — race friends to the finish line</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor + Steam Workshop</strong> — build and share your own courses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulties. One score to beat. No excuses.</p>",
